(Signal Roles) Tj
T* (PULSE_P drives the positive HV pulse toward +90 V) Tj
T* (PULSE_N drives the negative HV pulse toward -90 V) Tj
T* (DAMP_P / DAMP_N provide a brief 0 V RTZ clamp between pulse halves or at burst end) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (FPGA to provide: ) Tj
T* (FPGA_SIG_3.3V, PE remains LOW until all rails are valid, then goes HIGH to enable the pulser) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (PULSE-A: A ~423 ns window \(half the 1.18 MHz period\).) Tj
T* (   -Idle time, 10-50ns while idLe \(dead time\) to prevent shoot-through between DP 1+2 off & DN 1+2 on. ) Tj
T* (PULSE-B: A ~423 ns window, delayed by the first half-period.) Tj
